{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1547.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ba2391235cd425fd6b90aea9788f9576b44863b3d60e8acb673c279ffd7d2625","ja":"（あれ？　今の、このみさん？\n大きな買い物袋を持ってたけど、何を買ったのかな？）","zh":"（咦？刚才那是木实小姐吗？\n她拎着个大购物袋，买了什么呢？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1547.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2b6c6b6836cfa85392f89159bf9a7b92e73af25815ad05d0e05663228768101f","ja":"その翌日……","zh":"第二天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1547.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"4aca5b613ca62274e10924720ed9e8ab6ca28e3e911c2def4956481eed62090a","ja":"（探してたココアパウダー、買えてよかった！\n帰ったら、チョコクッキーを作ろっと♪）","zh":"（能买到一直在找的可可粉真是太好了！\n回去之后，来做巧克力饼干吧♪）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1547.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"ce5d309227acda5652dba453529dab739b0382f9019be40d40f8847660c6e3b7","ja":"あっ……とと……。\n危なく、落とすところだったわ……。","zh":"啊……哎呀呀……\n好险，差点就掉下来了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1547.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"a17609820af52599d65aa3a74fff91b9c62c8cc53a7cc20da417e5c6115d98a2","ja":"あれ？　このみさん！\n大丈夫ですか？　荷物、すごく重そうですけど。","zh":"哎呀？　木实小姐！\n没事吧？行李看着好沉的样子。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1547.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"62908ca141db8b4e36ed0736d470c6156fb72c2c006e00e6df87ae647272c860","ja":"わぁっ！？　あっ、春香ちゃん……！\nき、奇遇ねっ。","zh":"哇啊！？　啊、春香……！\n真、真巧呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1547.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"0fe9c56cd50081f68ec7d79bbef53f1a97113252e2f9f6770448b864dd134906","ja":"はい、お菓子の材料を買いに来ていて。\nこのみさんも、お買い物してたんですね。","zh":"是的，我是来买点心材料的。\n木实小姐也是来买东西的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1547.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"558033ca25884be4a35ab6fc6b615613c52df9b6226f804403da47559b883b95","ja":"でもその量だと、ひとりで運ぶのは\n大変じゃないですか？　よかったら、手伝いま……。","zh":"不过这个分量，一个人搬\n不是很辛苦吗？不介意的话，我来帮……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1547.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"5bac6edb73ea5b0138c68c97d9c659a942b77ced5241e0e086cbb9afb408936e","ja":"う、ううん、平気平気！　ちょっと買いすぎちゃった\nだけだからっ！！　じゃ、じゃあまたね～！","zh":"没、没事的，不要紧不要紧！只是不小心买多了\n而已啦！！那、那我先走啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1547.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"f426c78ea2ab3969b87a2e6aa74dd2375d40ecdc8a8c13e29a313fd8560bd328","ja":"あっ……はい。さようなら……？","zh":"啊……好的。再见……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
